  "note": "Complete streaming AWD/SCS reduction includes iterating fixed XYZ f64 memory-map chunks, integer classification, stable grouping, per-voxel PointAccumulator updates, finalization, Wasserstein and SCS index setup/destruction. The control uses preceding axis classification and one full-chunk boolean scan per voxel. Source coordinates, point order and chunk boundaries are unchanged; no generated data. Original-file loading, coordinate snapshot preparation/mapping/hashing, Gaussian/ordered-update tracing and CLI writes are outside clocks. The parity pair, an excluded first pair and one warm-up pair precede alternating timed pairs. No observations removed. Pages are warmed; this is not cold storage/CSV/LAS/PCD/PLY I/O or peak-RSS measurement. No NN/PLY, resident-evaluation, GPU or persistent-cache speed claim."
